            "caption": "Gate booth / returned",
            "status": "RETURNED"
          },
          "text": "The gate booth. The same bored man, the same book, and a second man standing behind you with no shoes on.",
          "id": "start.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "guard",
          "text": "Two of you.",
          "id": "start.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "recordist",
          "text": "I am going to sit down now.",
          "id": "start.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The guard opens the right column. RETURNED. He writes your name first, because you can still hold the pen. Then he writes the other name from memory.",
          "id": "start.line.4"
        },
        {
          "who": "guard",
          "text": "I kept a place for it. I thought that was superstition. It was filing.",
          "id": "start.line.5"
        }
      ],
